  resultSummary Json?

  // Retry bookkeeping — previously a check's result Task ending FAILED left
  // it stuck at RUNNING forever (no symmetric handler existed for anything
  // but a COMPLETED result task). attemptCount/maxAttempts bound the retry
  // loop; nextAttemptAt is when a FAILED->SCHEDULED retry becomes eligible
